WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.530
A doctor is working in Malaya.

2
00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:05.920
After about ten years,
he gives up his career.

3
00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:08.070
He wanders as a seeker.

4
00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:14.250
In 1924, in Rishikesh, he becomes
a renunciate: Swami Sivananda.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:15.920
Disciples come to him.

6
00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:18.620
His teaching spreads around the world.

7
00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:24.310
Yet Hinduism has no single head, no
central council and no one creed.

8
00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:27.120
So who has the authority to teach Hindus?

9
00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:29.070
And why do people listen?

10
00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:32.740
In this mission, you'll meet
four kinds of holy person.

11
00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:36.990
Then you'll weigh up whether a
Hindu today needs a guru at all.

12
00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:41.100
Your mission: find out who has
the authority to teach Hindus,

13
00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:42.610
and why people listen.
